/E (This proposal will lay out a comprehensive plan that, when implemented by Iowa State University, will gather general functionality issues from users of MyState on Android through campus-wide email surveys. This data will be used to develop updates with usability testing being conducted after each update. The updating and usability testing process will continue for 6 months or until the app performs as it should, that is, sitting above at least 3.5 stars out of 5 on the Play Store.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
