/P 111 0 R
/E (In fact, I think choosing external options would be a disservice to the fully capable developers here on campus. They are the ones most qualified to take on this project and learn as they do so, not just because they have talent and passion, but for this simple reason: students know students. They understand the daily rush of classes and meals and job searching and everything inbetween. They know what needs should be met by the MyState app. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
