/Title (The project also has the natural benefit of empowering student developers by allowing them a space to better their skills and gain experience with a real and active user base. It will give them helpful practice in app design, usability testing, and many more competencies that will help them post-graduation.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 608 0 R
/Prev 907 0 R
/Next 954 0 R
>>
endobj
954 0 obj
<<
/Title (The MyState overhaul is also cost-effective. Since development would be performed by students, the university would be making a worthy investment in the community without relying on expensive external consulting companies. In addition, the email campaign means that the university would spend little to nothing on marketing as well.)
